            "review_text": "Bassem D\nMelbourne, Australia21 contributions\n0\nBest Authentic Egyptian food in Hanoi\nJul 2024 • Family\nThis restaurant is the only place in Hanoi that sells authentic Egyptian food. The food is clean. The taste is what you typically get from a home made Egyptian dishes. The food is prepared fresh. \nThe desserts are delicious. \nThe management and chef are very helpful and accommodating. \nMy son wanted a particular dish that wasn't on the menu. They decided to make it specially for him.\nI highly recommend this restaurant to everyone who visits Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2024",
