            "review_text": "VitOmSau\n15 contributions\n0\nIt seems to be a restaurant that mainly serves Egyptian cuisine.\nNov 2023 • Couples\nI found this place after a four year walk around Dan Thai Mai Street.\n\nIt's a halal restaurant, but it seems their main dishes are Egyptian.\n\nI bought it as takeaway.\nThe owner is a very gentlemanly man, and the female staff are also very polite and I really like them.\nThe food was also very good, so I wish I had eaten at the restaurant.\n\nBeef shawarma WRAP 110,000d\nChicken Biryani 185,000d\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten December 14, 2023\nMawlana Restaurant & Cafe\nThanks for your comments! Mawlana wishes you always the best. And really WE hope to see you again!\nWritten December 21, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
