            "review_text": "Emma\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat food full of flavour\nSep 2023 • Friends\nThis cuisine is a great addition to the local restaurants in Tay Ho. Recommend exploring the menu for the authentic recipes tasty and full of flavour. Everything was fresh so may take a little time if you’re in a large group. But it’s worth the wait sit back and enjoy some delightful appetisers breads and dips were exceptional. \n\nA dry restaurant but none the less great evening with friends trying something new. \n\nDefinitely will be back to try some more delicious food a great location for lunch or dinner.\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2023\nMawlana Restaurant & Cafe\nThanks so much for your comment! Hopefully We could have more chances to serve you at our Mawlana.!\nWritten September 22, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
