            "review_text": "dexvan\nThe Hague, The Netherlands33 contributions\n0\nA touch of Arabia in South East Asia…\nSep 2023 • Family\nHmmm…\n\nWas really looking to this, as this flavour of restaurant in Ha Noi is fairly unique. I was part of a large group, which can be easily accommodated both inside or out. Service was friendly, however please be aware if you are in a rush to go elsewhere, this restaurant is probably not for you.\n\nThe food when it arrived was excellent, we ordered an array of starters but the highlight of the mains was the mixed grill! A feast fit for a king!!\n\nPlease be advised that this is a dry restaurant and also be prepared to enjoy whatever main course arrives in front of you! All part of the fun! Lol.\nRead more\nWritten September 2, 2023\nMawlana Restaurant & Cafe\nThanks so much for your comments! We really appreciate that and hopefully could see you again!\nWritten September 22, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
