            "review_text": "Út T\n1 contribution\n0\nArabic standard space\nJul 2023 • Family\nThe shop is beautifully designed, full of Arabic style!\nThe restaurant owner and chefs are all Egyptians 🇪🇬. They were quite friendly when I asked. My daughter really liked the restaurant and the restaurant! The taste is very easy to use and Vietnamese people can eat it every day! The mixed rice is very fragrant. I hope the minced beef and cheese noodles are my family's favorite. The price is reasonable and quite soft right in the center of Hanoi capital. Hope to come back to the capital often next time and visit the restaurant! Thank you so much!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2023\nMawlana Restaurant & Cafe\nThanks so much for your comment! We would love to see you again!\nWritten September 22, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
